<title>USA: Hopkins Cty, Texas, won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Hopkins Cty, Texas, won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $1.400 million of Hopkins Cty, Texas, limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.111 percent.</p>
</text>
